WEBVTT

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.810
Where... am I?

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:07.850
That's right...

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:09.900
The plane I was riding...

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.870
Am I going to die?

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:20.280
You're fine.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.860
Don't be afraid.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.010
You have me, Tomo.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:35.270
<i>Three years later</i>

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.040
Hey, Tomo!

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.750
Where should I put this?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.170
Just put it over there for now.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:59.600
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:18.830
"Asura Machina"

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.950
Who moves the day before their entrance ceremony?

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:34.270
It's not my fault they didn't tell me sooner.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:39.010
Your mom sure is something to get remarried and kick out her own flesh and blood.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.470
She says I'll interfere with her life as a newlywed.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.380
Does she mean that in a naughty way?

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.890
Ask her yourself.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.510
Well, I can't say I'm not jealous.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.510
I wouldn't mind living on my own.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.390
All that cooking and cleaning is going to be a hassle.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.270
Cry me a river.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.730
You'll have total freedom.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:00.660
And I bet this place is haunted. Way to go, Tomoharu.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.260
I wouldn't call that a good thing.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.880
I guess you can't really bring a girl back to a place like this.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.440
That's true no matter where I'm living.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.280
Huh? Did you say something?

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:17.700
This place is haunted for sure.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:21.730
As an expert on the supernatural, I'm sure of it.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:24.220
Help me out here.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.300
Let's set up surveillance cameras.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.830
I have some that are perfect for taking ghost pictures.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:32.180
I found something even better than those polariods.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.860
Looks like I won't get to finish unpacking today.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.730
How much is your rent?

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:41.020
I don't know. My brother's paying for it.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.900
He's in Africa, right?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:46.010
He sent me a postcard from India the other day.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.220
And you got calls from South America, too.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.710
What kind of study abroad program is your brother enrolled in?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.270
I have no idea what he's thinking.

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:55.980
Okay!

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.700
Are you finally going to help me unpack?

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:03.110
I'm going to check out the premises! Ghosts hang out in the bathroom, right?

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.000
But I'm already here.

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:13.360
A ghost and a cute girl.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.440
Is that your decision?

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:37.430
Tomo, I don't remember you having such expensive looking stuff.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.020
That belongs to you two.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.740
You're Mr. Naotaka's brother, aren't you?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:45.590
Huh?

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.020
Aren't you?

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.320
Y-yes.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.320
Are you my brother's...

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.840
Yes. An acquaintance.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:55.290
I'm sorry, but he hasn't come back from...

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.010
I know.

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:59.620
I came for you, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:04.510
Mr. Naotaka asked me to deliver this to you.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.920
My brother didn't mention anything about this...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.880
It belongs to both of you.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.040
I'm sure of it.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.200
Hold on to it.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.000
It's extremely important.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:26.020
Tomo, that person could see me.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.160
Hey, who was that hottie?

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.460
Do you know her?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.030
She knows my brother.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.450
What's in here, gold bricks?

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:39.580
Yeah, right.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.520
Let's open it.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:42.790
How?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.330
What are you doing?

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.950
I guess it isn't a bomb, then.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.440
I'm sure you didn't have to do that to figure that out.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.280
Not even a scratch.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.600
What's this?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.720
Where is the Asura Machina?

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:51.590
Give me the extractor.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.660
It is a dangerous entity.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.460
Is that your decision?

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.330
It won't be easy.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.280
Where is the Asura Machina?

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:18.430
Tomo!

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:20.680
A projection body?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:28.670
Tomo!

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:30.550
Projection body?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.420
I don't know. I've never heard of it.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.000
Two people that can see Misao in one day.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:39.290
What's going on?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.520
"Rakurowa High School Entrance Ceremony"

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:58.550
Misao.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:07:59.330
What?

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.860
Where did you get that uniform?

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:02.920
It's a secret.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:05.000
These uniforms sure are cute.

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:08.380
How do you change, anyway?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.380
Why, because I'm a ghost?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:13.030
Don't you usually just wear whatever you had on last?

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.180
That's no fun.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.460
Don't you prefer a fashionable ghost, Tomo?

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:22.010
I guess if I have the choice...

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.300
Good.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.800
Good morning, Tomo.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:29.760
Good morning, An.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.600
Did you see the class roster?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.660
We're together again.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.050
Are you going to keep doing track?

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:36.620
Yeah. What about you?

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.990
My dad said not to worry about work if you're going to join a club.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:43.110
If I'm doing anything, I'll probably do track again.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.640
I want to keep working, though.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:47.920
You've got to save up for living expenses.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.770
Tomo! Ohara!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:51.510
Higuchi!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.760
You're in our class, too.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.640
So are Saeki and Takatsuki.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:56.260
Who?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.260
You know, Reiko Saeki.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.000
The girl that won last year's culture festival beauty contest.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.910
No, I meant the other one.

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.590
You don't know?

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.840
Northern Middle School's Kanade Takatsuki.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.510
She's a real beauty.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.730
I've heard of her.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:12.510
She must be famous.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.210
But there's something to be said for the appeal of an older woman.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.180
Tomo, this woman...!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:19.060
Who is that?

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.640
Shuri Kurosaki.

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.710
She's a sophomore and acting president of the Science Club.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.210
I'm surprised you know them.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.660
No known hotties escape my information network.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:34.400
"Rakurowa High School Entrance Ceremony"

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:35.520
New students and families...

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.030
Asura Machina...

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:38.770
Extractor...

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.170
Projection body...

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:44.030
I guess that Kurosaki girl has something to do with all of this.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:47.820
I don't really understand, but I'm curious about that trunk.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.490
Should we go see her?

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.160
You decide.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:01.510
You sure creeped that girl out.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.690
You played a part in it, too.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:05.500
She can't see me.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.470
I guess I let my guard down over spring break.

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.690
I need to be careful about talking to you.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.020
You sure do.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.270
I don't want to be stuck with a weirdo.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.130
Her!

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.090
Hey!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.370
You came to my house last night, didn't you?

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.940
N-no.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:38.730
Let go.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:41.150
I just want to ask you something...

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.780
What are you doing, Natsume?

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:45.620
Saeki.

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:48.730
I thought were a decent guy.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.190
I guess you're just like Higuchi.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.590
You've got it wrong.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.720
There's a reason...

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:54.810
What reason?

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:56.650
Didn't you come to my house last night?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:10:59.970
She says she didn't.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.780
But I'm sure she...

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:05.120
If you're going to hit on someone, you've got to come up with some better lines.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:08.540
Something like, "I'll never forget last night."

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.590
Let's go, Miss Takatsuki.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.010
So she's the girl Higuchi was talking about.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.250
Everyone's staring at you, Tomo.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.840
Looks like you've made enemies with all the guys.

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.000
Hey, Higuchi.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.280
Does that girl live at a temple?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.100
Huh?

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.250
Or maybe she has a twin sister?

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.330
What are you talking about?

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.950
"Class 1-7"

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.540
Maybe she's someone else.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.720
She may look similar, but she seems totally different.

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.410
Maybe.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.600
Sneaking out again?

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.270
What do you mean, "again?"

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:13.000
If Takatsuki is a no, Shuri Kurosaki is next.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.850
I'm not like you.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.200
This is a good sign.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:20.410
The late bloomer Tomoharu Natsume's fancy has finally turned to love.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.840
But sneaking out is unforgivable.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.720
"Science Building"

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.720
Wow.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.190
"Science Prep Room"

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.190
This is amazing, Tomo.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:31.370
This is all the stuff I've been looking for.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.560
This is too good!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.330
What does he want with all of this?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:36.870
Oh.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.950
Oh, hello.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.520
I see you've already made it this far.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.900
You really are Mr. Naotaka's brother.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.150
No, no. It was me.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.150
I'm the one that researched you.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.260
And you are?

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:51.450
Higuchi.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.570
Class 1-7, Takuma Higuchi.

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.010
I see.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:01.560
Welcome to the Science Club, Tomoharu.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:04.670
I didn't come here to join the club.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:05.380
Why not?

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.850
What do you mean?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:10.810
Mr. Naotaka made the Science Club for you.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.770
You're not curious about that trunk?

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.910
What about that cutie following you around?

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.510
If you join the Science Club and become my assistant...

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:23.410
...I'd be more than happy to tell you anything you'd like to know.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.120
Anything?

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.350
Is that all you care about?

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:30.450
So naturally, you'll be joining us.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:31.710
Right, Tomoharu?

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.110
There's not much of a choice.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.930
Let me think about it.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.930
"I'm sorry."

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.140
Who's it from?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.120
"Ohara Liquor"

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.870
Maybe she's using you, Tomo.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.270
Using me?

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:02.440
There are a lot of weird rumors about Kurosaki-senpai.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.280
That the yakuza's afraid of her.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.620
Or that she has guns.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.120
Yeah, right.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.430
Maybe the trunk is full of drugs.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.000
Or guns. I bet it's guns.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.700
Why would she give me something like that?

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.090
Naotaka's living overseas, right?

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:18.050
So?

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:21.020
I bet he stole the goods the yakuza bought from the mafia...

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:24.870
...so he asked Kurosaki-senpai to hide them at your house!

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.060
That's ridiculous.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:28.900
Naotaka's a genius.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:32.280
He's only a student, but he's a technology consultant for major corporations.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:34.030
He's got a lot of patents, too.

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:37.030
There's plenty of reasons for him to be involved in shady dealings!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.010
Those are hardly related.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:41.280
In Naotaka's case, it may not be too far off the mark.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.660
You too?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.020
Uh, nothing.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:47.960
Forget about the Science Club.

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:50.180
Come do track with me.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:51.820
Track, huh?

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.690
Yeah, track!

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.840
What do you think?

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.250
Roses have thorns, don't they?

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.750
What are you saying?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.960
I'm talking about Miss Kurosaki and Kanade Takatsuki.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.290
Thorns, huh?

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.330
I guess I shouldn't get involved with them.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.650
It's too late for that.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.650
You accepted that trunk.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.880
And you got attacked by a shrine maiden that looked like Kanade Takatsuki.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:19.780
I'm going to return that trunk.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:22.410
I think it would be worth trying.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.410
Huh? What do you mean?

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.290
I don't think she'd be eager to take it back.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:29.290
Don't you have anything good to say?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:32.790
We're home!

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:35.110
Nobody's here.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:46.760
Mafia?

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.380
Hand over the extractor.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.530
Is that the name of some drug?

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:56.690
Where is it?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.560
Is it the name of some kind of gun instead?

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.840
Time is a valuable thing.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.350
Don't you agree?

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.050
Y-yes, it is.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.790
Then let's stop wasting it, shall we?

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.440
What is that?

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.320
It'll make you feel great.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.880
I'll ask you one more time.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.690
Where is the extractor?

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.250
Spit it out.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:27.010
We already know Kurosaki brought it here.

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:27.900
Tomo!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.990
Do they mean...?

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.160
Excuse the intrusion.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:45.590
Senpai.

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:47.300
Shuri Kurosaki.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.700
You didn't waste any time finding this place, Reishiro.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.470
Is the Dark Society involved in this, too?

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:58.020
That would make this a war of religions, wouldn't it?

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.420
What will you do?

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:01.230
Sir!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:02.560
What?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.890
The enemy is attacking!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:16.010
It's the widespread demon association Takatsuki group.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.860
Those demons...!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:18.810
There they are!

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.840
We'll have to put our war on hold.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:36.540
Fire at will.

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:38.620
Eliminate any obstacles at your discretion.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:41.010
Take cover.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.650
What is she?

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.890
Get those heretic inquisitors!

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.430
Demon scum!

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.470
The extractor must be...

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:06.410
...that trunk!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.210
I've got to do something about this shootout.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:10.920
My house...

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:13.720
How much longer are you going to keep doing that?

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:16.010
You know I can't handle high places!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:18.470
Then why didn't you go through your house?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.790
What if I get shot?

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:22.460
Hurry up.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.000
Fine, fine.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.240
There, there. Good job.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.640
What do we do now?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.510
I'm giving this to them.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:36.190
To whom?

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.610
As long as the shooting stops, I don't care.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.760
In that case, I'll take that.

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.220
Don't worry.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.640
If you'll give us the extractor, we'll leave.

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:54.460
Didn't I tell you to hold on to it, Tomoharu?

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:55.650
Give me a break.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:59.370
If it's that important, why don't you keep it?

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:00.400
I can't do that.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.550
That belongs to the two of you.

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.000
Why, if it isn't the young chief.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.540
Long time, no see.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:15.660
Please stop this!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.660
Open the trunk, Tomoharu.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:18.600
Kurosaki!

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:21.060
They're after its contents.

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:23.310
What's in here?

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:26.720
If you value your life, don't move.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.010
Just hand it over.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.010
Don't you want this to end?

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:32.600
Hurry and open it.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.430
Open it.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.520
What's wrong, Misao?

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.230
Open it, Tomo.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.460
Misao.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.880
But... how?

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:48.300
Command it. It should open.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.570
Quiet, Kurosaki!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.040
Tomo.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:56.840
I'll open it.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:19:59.780
Hisui!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.450
W-what is this?

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.050
Is it responding to Hisui?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:22.650
Command it, Tomoharu.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.020
Tomo!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:27.500
Eliminate them all, Hisui!

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:30.410
Tomo!

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:32.220
Hurry!

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:40.720
Open!

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:49.630
It's empty?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.360
The darkness of Schwarzwald...

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.180
T-Tomo.

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:02.610
What is this?

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.400
Asura Machina.

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:39.140
Is that your decision?

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:41.630
It won't be easy.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:42.800
Tomoharu.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:49.010
If this will let me save her...

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:25.060
"Preview"

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.190
When the balance is destroyed...

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.190
...possibility will not be saved.

00:23:24.550 --> 00:23:25.130
A dream?

00:23:25.230 --> 00:23:26.500
A world of deceit.

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:28.370
When? We don't know.

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:29.600
We can't go home.

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:30.700
Save us.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:35.030
"Destruction of the future"
